  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEm">II Em</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be blodgeote.] [Ld] Eac ic cyðe, þæt ic nelle socne habban [þone ðe mannes blod geote] to minum hirede, ær he hæbbe g[od]cunde bote underfangan ⁊ wið ða mægðe gebet—on bote befangen—⁊ to ælcum rihte gebogen, swa biscop him tæce ðe hit on his scyre sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Further, I declare that I forbid anyone [who commits homicide] to have right of access to my household, until he has undertaken to make amends as the church requires, and has made—or set about making—reparation to the kin, and has submitted to every legal penalty prescribed by the bishop in whose diocese it is.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eac ic cyðe, þæt ic nelle socne habban to minum hirede, ær he hæbbe godcunde bote underfangan ⁊ wið þa mægðer gebet on bote befangen ⁊ to ælcum rihte gebogen, swa biscop him tæce, ðe hit on his scyre sy.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
